[Title: Here comes a frog.]

350
01:02:24,568 --> 01:02:29,568
[Title: タイミングよく A ボタンを押して高くジャンプさせてあげよう！]
[Title: Press the A button with good timing to make it jump high!]

351
01:02:30,068 --> 01:02:32,068
はい！
Okay!

352
01:02:32,068 --> 01:02:35,068
