Boing, boing, boing, boing.

353
01:02:36,568 --> 01:02:40,568
こういうことか！はいはいはい。
So that's how it is! I see, I see.

354
01:02:41,068 --> 01:02:54,568
たっ、たっ、たっ、たっ...
Boing, boing, boing, boing...

355
01:02:55,568 --> 01:02:58,068
[Title: OK。]
[Title: OK.]

356
01:02:58,068 --> 01:03:03,568
こういうこと？こういうことなんじゃない？うん。のじゃ。
Is this it? Isn't this it? Yeah. You know.

357
01:03:04,068 --> 01:03:07,068
